                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Invasion is a solid timekiller. It's very easy to dive in and the gameplay is very addictive. It plays like classic Space Invaders but much more intense and I would say - insane. Enemy projectiles are flying all over the place but luckily you have a slow-mo feature to survive in this bullet hell. Visuals and special effects are nice. Music is a highlight of the game - it's just awesome and perfectly fits the gameplay. The difficulty curve seems fair since the game introduces new types of enemies each new level. \nSo if you have some time to kill - go for it!\nThe game still needs some polishing, but already has strong fundamentals.",
